  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for children in Sierra Leone affected by the Ebola crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide support for 120 children who have been affected by the Ebola crisis.  They include orphaned children, survivors of infection, those whose parents have been infected and the children of households accepting survivors. The project will run for 12 months.</narrative>
  </description>
